### AI Message Rendering

The project uses a structured approach for rendering AI messages:

- `ChatMessage` type with `parts` array containing different part types
- `isToolUIPart()`, `isTextPart()`, etc. for type guards
- Separate components for each part type (code-block, reasoning, tool, etc.)
